# Cloudflare Pages: make the page "cross-origin isolated" so the optional
# multi-core FFmpeg engine can use SharedArrayBuffer. "require-corp" (not
# "credentialless") because Safari / every iPhone browser only supports this one;
# Google Fonts are loaded with crossorigin, the CDN and the Worker answer with CORS.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
